License scope for rk3128-linux
==============================

This repository is a collection of reference sources with multiple licenses.
It is not offered under one license that replaces the licenses of its parts.

Original kernel enablement code, and original supplemental tools, examples,
configuration and documentation without another stated license, are licensed
under GNU GPL version 2 only (SPDX: GPL-2.0-only), Copyright (C) 2026 Comzee.
The original contributions are made available under that grant by their owner.
Existing per-file grants, including MIT and GPL-2.0-or-later, are preserved.
Original modifications to existing third-party files follow those files'
license grants unless a source section expressly states otherwise. This includes
userspace and experimental patches and modifications within the SSV source tree.

Third-party code, patch context and adaptations retain their upstream licenses
and copyright notices. A patch is subject to the licenses of its target files
and its explicitly marked sections. See NOTICE.md, the source headers and
manifests/licenses.json for scope. In particular, the SSV Wi-Fi reference tree
contains GPL-3.0-or-later code; it is not relabeled GPL-2.0-only.

Full license texts and the Linux syscall exception are in LICENSES/.
A file's "or later" choice or dual-license alternatives are not removed by
the names of those text files. GPL-2.0 and GPL-2.0+ in retained historical SPDX
headers mean GPL version 2 only and GPL version 2 or later, respectively.

No warranty is provided; the relevant license terms apply. Open-source reuse
remains subject to those terms. Firmware binaries are not supplied.
